  "bulletin": {
    "id": "1198",
    "issue_date": "2026-06-24T02:15:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2026-06-24T02:01:58.600Z",
    "meteorologist": "Hari Dahal",
    "analysis_np": "हाल कोशी, मधेश र बागमती प्रदेशका सम्पुर्ण भू-भाग, गण्डकी प्रदेशको केही भू-भाग र लुम्बिनी प्रदेशको पूर्वी भू-भागको थोरै स्थानमा मनसुनी वायूको प्रभाव रहेको छ । अन्य भू-भागमा पश्चिमी वायू र स्थानीय वायूको आंशिक प्रभाव रहेको छ।",
    "analysis_en": "At present, the monsoon wind is influencing the entire areas of Koshi, Madhesh, and Bagmati provinces, some parts of Gandaki Province, and a few places in the eastern region of Lumbini Province. In the remaining areas, there is a partial influence of the westerly wind and local winds.",
    "today_np": "देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । मधेश प्रदेश तथा बागमती, गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ। कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा मधेश प्रदेश, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशको तराईका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ। लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानहरूमा तातो लहर तथा बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका केही स्थानमा पनि  तातो दिन हुने सम्भावना छ ।",
    "today_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country as well as the Terai region of Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over Madhesh Province and the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces. The Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces are expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country. There is also a possibility of moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and at one or two places in the Terai regions of Madhesh, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces. Heatwave conditions are likely at some places in the Terai regions of Lumbini and Sudurpashchim Provinces, while hot day conditions are also likely at some places in the Terai regions of Bagmati and Gandaki Provinces.",
    "tomorrow_np": "देशका हिमाली र पहाडी भू-भाग साथै कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागमा साधारणतया बादल लाग्नेछ । मधेश प्रदेशमा आंशिक बादल लाग्नेछ । बागमती, गण्डकी, लुम्बिनी र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको तराई भू-भागमा मौसम मूख्यतया सफा रहनेछ । कोशी, बागमती र गण्डकी प्रदेशका हिमाली र पहाडी  भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा लुम्बिनी, कर्णाली र सुदूरपश्चिम प्रदेशको हिमाली भू-भागका एक-दुई स्थानमा  मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षा/हिमपातको सम्भावना छ । कोशी प्रदेशका तराई भू-भागका थोरै स्थानमा तथा मधेश प्रदेशका एक-दुई स्थानमा मेघगर्जन/चट्याङ्ग सहित मध्यमसम्मको वर्षाको सम्भावना छ ।",
    "tomorrow_en": "Generally cloudy conditions are likely over the Hilly and Himalayan regions of the country as well as the Terai region of Koshi Province. Partly cloudy conditions are likely over Madhesh Province. The Terai regions of Bagmati, Gandaki, Lumbini, and Sudurpashchim Provinces are expected to remain mainly fair. There is a possibility of moderate rainfall/snowfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in theHilly and Himalayan regions of Koshi, Bagmati, and Gandaki Provinces, and at one or two places in the Himalayan regions of Lumbini, Karnali, and Sudurpashchim Provinces. There is also a possibility of moderate rainfall accompanied by thunder and lightning at a few places in the Terai region of Koshi Province and at one or two places in Madhesh Province.",
    "special": ""
